  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S Ganga Traders vs State Of U.P. on 9 January, 2020 Author: Kaushal Jayendra Thaker Bench: Kaushal Jayendra Thaker High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 33 Case :- First Appeal From Order",
    "facts": "The judgment of Mool Chand Yadav (supra) which has been entrusted into service was in realm of civil dispute whereas hear it is under special statute namely Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006. It is submitted that Rule 3.3.4 reads as follows: \"3.3.4: Orders of Appellate Tribunal and related matters 1.",
    "arguments": "2. The Judgment of Mool Chand Yadav versus Raza Buland Sugar Company Limited is based on Code of Civil Procedure, 1908 Order XLI Rule 5. The judgment of Mool Chand Yadav (Supra) does not say that the Court rather the appellate Court will not have any jurisdiction to direct deposit of certain amount.",
